      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Config').first().json.reportRecipients }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.title }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.report_markdown }}",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2228e1ef-bf8f-4b8f-bf4f-4afb2ca2068b",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 23 · AI Report Generator\nEvery Monday pulls metrics from your data endpoint and writes an executive weekly report with highlights and risks.\n\n**Trigger:** schedule `0 7 * * 1`\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate."
      }
    }
  ],
